'''Nidhögg the Thundering''' is the upgraded form of [[Nidhögg]] using the [[Iolite]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use [[Iolite]], they gain 10 [[Lightning|lightning damage]] and their hit effect has a 25% chance to apply [[Chain Lightning]].

* The primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit. No damage penalty against multiple targets.
* Its secondary attack deals 3x damage with a slightly longer reach.

An upgraded Nidhögg will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Nidhögg the Thundering.

